<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide Q1 sales up 12.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide Q1 sales up 12.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					9,017    vs   8,023</p>
<p>     - gas					  6,742    vs   5,923</p>
<p>     - welding					972    vs     952</p>
<p>     - engineering and construction	   229    vs     230</p>
<p>     - chemicals and other		    1,074    vs     918</p>
<p>NOTE - Air Liquide said in a statement that on a constant currency basis sales rose 8.6 percent of which 2.4 percent of the growth was due to new acquisitions. Although the first quarter is set against a weak corresponding year earlier period, &quot;it shows nevertheless the improvement in sales since the end of 1996, reinforced by the start of contracts resulting from commercial successes by the group in 1995 and 1996,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
